From 9d4af5314500f4e406a8c4ff1c0699072f8c7758 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: abhay-byte <abhay02delhi@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 10:31:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] jm-v7 045: vertexPipelineStoresAndAtomics on v6/v7

v6/v7 have no IDVS (jm-v7 006): the vertex shader runs in a plain VERTEX
job, once per vertex of the draw's vertex range and instance, before the
geometry emulation or the tiler, so its stores and atomics run a known
number of times and never speculatively. The Bifrost compiler emits
global stores and atomics in vertex shaders (tess eval and the TCS
inputs already rely on that). Turn the feature on with the same drirc
switch as v9+ (pan_enable_vertex_pipeline_stores_atomics, default on).

Indexed draws shade the [min, max] index range found by the GPU
min/max search, so a vertex inside the range that no index references is
shaded too (allowed: the number of vertex shader invocations is
implementation-defined). Layered draws shade per layer.

Unblocks PanProbe vertex_stores, draw_params and gs_tess_primitive_id
(skipped before).
---
 src/panfrost/vulkan/panvk_vX_physical_device.c | 6 ++++--
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/panfrost/vulkan/panvk_vX_physical_device.c b/src/panfrost/vulkan/panvk_vX_physical_device.c
index 7587dbc..c6ab245 100644
--- a/src/panfrost/vulkan/panvk_vX_physical_device.c
+++ b/src/panfrost/vulkan/panvk_vX_physical_device.c
@@ -354,9 +354,11 @@ panvk_per_arch(get_physical_device_features)(
          indices anymore. On v9-v12, pre-rasterization stages that write
          memory run through gpu_prerast compute instead of IDVS. On by default
          on v9+ (DXVK FL11_1); pan_enable_vertex_pipeline_stores_atomics=false
-         turns it off. */
+         turns it off. On v6/v7 there is no IDVS (jm-v7 006): the vertex job
+         runs the VS once per vertex of the draw's index range and instance
+         (jm-v7 045). */
       .vertexPipelineStoresAndAtomics =
-         (PAN_ARCH >= 9 && instance->drirc.misc.enable_vertex_pipeline_stores_atomics) ||
+         instance->drirc.misc.enable_vertex_pipeline_stores_atomics ||
          instance->drirc.misc.force_enable_shader_atomics,
       .fragmentStoresAndAtomics = true,
       /* v6/v7: jm-v7 033 (TES point size, GS point output size). */
